text = "A corrupted arcade survival game\n\n1  ENDLESS\nEscalating enemy pressure, Signal Loss, Doomsday waves.\n\n2  CAMPAIGN\nThree short levels with increasing enemy variety.\n\n3  DEBUG ENDLESS\nAll enemy types spawn with equal probability for testing.\n\nControls: WASD/Arrows move | Mouse aim | Hold Left Click shoot | Right Click autofire | Q cone shockwave | ESC pause\n\nPickups despawn after 4 seconds. Kill enemies to level up and charge ultra."
